From 854610a56452436dbc145556aee027111aba49f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:14:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Smart Campaigns: 'Preview on homepage (5 min)' button
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A campaign editor button that forces the campaign onto the live homepage for 5
minutes so the owner can see it exactly as customers would — regardless of the
weather rules, and without touching saved campaigns.

- smartCampaigns.js: a shared campaignToSlides() builder + an in-memory,
  auto-expiring preview (setPreview/activePreview/previewPlan). Never persisted.
- /api/config injects the preview banner first (winning over normal weather
  resolution, and working even with no campaigns configured yet); dedupes if the
  same campaign is already showing. New endpoints POST /api/admin/smartcampaigns/
  preview and .../preview/stop.
- Admin: the button posts the campaign being edited (its artwork is already
  uploaded, so it previews even before you Save) and opens the homepage in a new
  tab. Preview ignores the paused/active toggle so you can test a draft.
---
